<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:sy="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title>Linux on Hex Blog</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/tags/linux/</link><description>Recent content in Linux on Hex Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh</language><managingEditor>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</managingEditor><webMaster>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</webMaster><copyright>©2026, All Rights Reserved</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 08 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://hex-go.github.io/tags/linux/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Linux-面试速记-bash脚本</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/interview/2024-04-15-linux-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%80%9F%E8%AE%B0-bash%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%AC/</link><pubDate>Tue, 08 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Tue, 08 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/interview/2024-04-15-linux-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%80%9F%E8%AE%B0-bash%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%AC/</guid><description>知识 规范 文件系统层次标准(FHS)：规范目录中存放的内容所指定的标准。解决两个问题：文件放哪里；文件去哪里找。 Posix规范： 1. 文件管理 1.1 2.</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>面试</category></item><item><title>Linux面试-137面试题</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/interview/2024-04-09-linux%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95-137%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/</link><pubDate>Sat, 05 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Sat, 05 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/interview/2024-04-09-linux%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95-137%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/</guid><description>汇总的Linux面试题，仅用于个人备忘 1、如何看当前Linux系统有几颗物理CPU和每颗CPU的核数？ 查看物理cup： 1 cat /proc/cpuinfo|grep -c ‘physic</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>面试</category><category>面试</category></item><item><title>Linux面试-awk面试题</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/interview/2024-04-09-linux%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95-awk%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/</link><pubDate>Sat, 05 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Sat, 05 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/interview/2024-04-09-linux%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95-awk%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/</guid><description>重要 awk 面试通常考察三个点：字段处理（$1/$NF）、模式匹配（/pattern/）、BEGIN/END 块。不需要背 API，但要能解释 awk '{print $1}' access.log</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>面试</category><category>面试</category></item><item><title>开发环境代理配置——从原理到实践</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/2024-06-22-%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/</link><pubDate>Sat, 22 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Sat, 22 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/2024-06-22-%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/</guid><description>重要 代理的本质是&amp;quot;中间人转发&amp;quot;——客户端不直接连目标，而是通过代理服务器中转。不同代理模式决定了哪些流量被拦截、哪些工具</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Docker</category><category>Linux</category><category>个人工具</category></item><item><title>Linux网络-常用命令</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2024-04-23-linux%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C-%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</link><pubDate>Wed, 24 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Wed, 24 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2024-04-23-linux%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C-%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</guid><description>ifconfig ：查询、设置网卡的相关参数; ifup/ifdown：这两个文件是script，启动、关闭网络接口; route ：查询、设定路由表 (route table) ip：复合式的指</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>CNI</category><category>Linux</category><category>Linux</category></item><item><title>Linux-网络基础</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2024-04-23-linux%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C-%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/</link><pubDate>Tue, 23 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Tue, 23 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2024-04-23-linux%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C-%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/</guid><description>物理层 &amp;ndash; 数据链路层 &amp;ndash; 网络层 &amp;mdash;- 传输层 &amp;ndash; 会话层 &amp;ndash; 表达层 &amp;ndash; 应用层 &amp;ndash; MAC,ARP &amp;ndash; IP &amp;ndash; TCP/UDP,PORT &amp;ndash; LAN: 区域网络(Local Area Network) WAN: 广域网络(Wide Area Network) 数据链路层(MAC</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>CNI</category><category>Linux</category><category>Linux</category></item><item><title>Linux 基础-服务管理（init / service / systemd）</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2024-04-22-linux%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80-%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86/</link><pubDate>Mon, 22 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 22 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2024-04-22-linux%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80-%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86/</guid><description>重要 Linux 服务管理经历三代：init（串行启动）→ service（init 的脚本封装）→ systemd（并行启动 + Unit 统一管理）。2015 年后新发</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>Linux</category></item><item><title>Linux基础-FHS文件系统层次标准</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2024-04-22-linux%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80-fhs%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%B1%82%E6%AC%A1%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86/</link><pubDate>Mon, 22 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 22 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2024-04-22-linux%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80-fhs%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%B1%82%E6%AC%A1%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86/</guid><description>核心结论 说明 FHS 解决“文件应该放哪里”的问题 统一 Linux 目录用途，降低运维和软件适配成本 /etc 放配置，/var 放可变数据，/usr 放大部分用户态软件资源</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>Linux</category></item><item><title>Linux基础-POSIX标准说明</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2024-04-22-linux%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86-posix/</link><pubDate>Mon, 22 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 22 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2024-04-22-linux%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86-posix/</guid><description>核心结论 说明 POSIX 是接口标准，不是操作系统 它定义程序和操作系统之间的 API / Shell / 工具行为 Linux 基本遵循 POSIX，但不是所有 GNU 扩展都属于 POSIX 脚本写法是否可</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>Linux</category></item><item><title>Linux基础-服务管理-实战</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2024-04-22-linux%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80-%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98/</link><pubDate>Mon, 22 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 22 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2024-04-22-linux%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80-%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98/</guid><description>Systemd相关文件 /usr/lib/systemd/system/xx.service 配置文件 命令举例 开机自启动 1 systemctl enable httpd 启动服务 1 systemctl start httpd 查看服务状态 1 systemctl status httpd 停止服务 1 systemctl stop httpd 加载配置文件 1 systemctl daemon-reload 重启服务 1 systemctl</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>Linux</category></item><item><title>Linux基础-启动流程</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2024-04-22-linux%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80-%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B/</link><pubDate>Mon, 22 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 22 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2024-04-22-linux%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80-%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B/</guid><description>核心结论 说明 Linux 启动不是从内核开始，而是从固件开始 UEFI/BIOS 完成硬件初始化后，才进入 Bootloader 内核启动后第一个用户态进程是 PID 1 现代发行版通常是 systemd，</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>Linux</category></item><item><title>Linux效率-终端快捷命令</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2024-04-09-linux%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87-%E7%BB%88%E7%AB%AF%E5%BF%AB%E6%8D%B7%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</link><pubDate>Tue, 09 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Tue, 09 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2024-04-09-linux%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87-%E7%BB%88%E7%AB%AF%E5%BF%AB%E6%8D%B7%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</guid><description>核心结论 说明 大多数快捷键来自 Readline Bash、Python REPL、MySQL CLI 等交互程序常复用这套编辑能力 Ctrl+s 不是暂停程序，而是终端流控 它发送 XOFF 暂</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>Linux</category></item><item><title>sudo echo 重定向报权限拒绝的原因与处理</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2023-08-28-k8s%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95-4-sudo%E6%8F%90%E6%9D%83echo%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%91%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%AC%A6%E4%BC%9A%E6%8A%A5%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF/</link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Aug 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 28 Aug 2023 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2023-08-28-k8s%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95-4-sudo%E6%8F%90%E6%9D%83echo%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%91%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%AC%A6%E4%BC%9A%E6%8A%A5%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF/</guid><description>重要 sudo echo 'xxx' &amp;gt;&amp;gt; /etc/hosts 会报权限拒绝。原因：sudo 只作用于 echo，&amp;gt;&amp;gt; 重定向由当前 shell 以普通用户权限打开文件。 1.简介 Kubelet 集群部署时需要修</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>故障排查</category><category>Linux</category><category>Bash</category><category>k8s部署实录</category></item><item><title>Ubuntu系统dd命令备份和恢复系统</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/2022-07-08-ubuntu_dd%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%A4%87%E4%BB%BD%E5%92%8C%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/</link><pubDate>Fri, 08 Jul 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Fri, 08 Jul 2022 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/2022-07-08-ubuntu_dd%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%A4%87%E4%BB%BD%E5%92%8C%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/</guid><description>重要 最重要的事: 1.简介 dd指令是一个简单的复制指令，它不管源和目标的编码、格式、数据结构，简单粗暴的把二进制数据从A复制到B。 所以恢复的目</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>个人工具</category></item><item><title>bash脚本set命令说明</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2022-03-30-bash%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%ACset%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E/</link><pubDate>Wed, 30 Mar 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Wed, 30 Mar 2022 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2022-03-30-bash%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%ACset%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E/</guid><description>核心结论 说明 set -e 不是万能错误处理 它有很多例外场景，不能替代显式判断 set -u 处理的是未定义变量，不是空变量 变量已定义但值为空不会报错 管道必须配合 set</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>Linux</category></item><item><title>Linux查漏补缺-4: 安装包管理</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2023-11-02-linux%E6%9F%A5%E6%BC%8F%E8%A1%A5%E7%BC%BA-4_%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E5%8C%85%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86/</link><pubDate>Mon, 07 Dec 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 07 Dec 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2023-11-02-linux%E6%9F%A5%E6%BC%8F%E8%A1%A5%E7%BC%BA-4_%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E5%8C%85%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86/</guid><description>核心结论 说明 RPM / DEB 是包格式，也是底层包管理体系 负责安装、卸载、查询本地包，但依赖处理能力有限 YUM / DNF / APT 是仓库管理器 负责从远程仓库解析依赖、下</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>Linux</category><category>Linux操作系统-查漏补缺</category></item><item><title>Linux查漏补缺-3-特殊设备文件[loop,null,zero,full,random,tcp..]</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2022-10-27-linux%E6%9F%A5%E6%BC%8F%E8%A1%A5%E7%BC%BA-3-%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6loopnullzerofullrandomtcp../</link><pubDate>Sat, 05 Dec 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Sat, 05 Dec 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2022-10-27-linux%E6%9F%A5%E6%BC%8F%E8%A1%A5%E7%BC%BA-3-%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6loopnullzerofullrandomtcp../</guid><description>核心结论 说明 /dev/null 是黑洞，/dev/zero 是零流 前者读到 EOF，后者读出无限 \0 /dev/full 专门用于模拟磁盘写满 写入永远返回 ENOSPC 现代 Linux 中 /dev/random 和 /dev/urandom 差异已经很小 随</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>Linux</category><category>Linux操作系统-查漏补缺</category></item><item><title>Linux查漏补缺-2-特殊权限[s·t]</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2022-10-26-linux%E6%9F%A5%E6%BC%8F%E8%A1%A5%E7%BC%BA-2-%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90st/</link><pubDate>Thu, 03 Dec 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Thu, 03 Dec 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2022-10-26-linux%E6%9F%A5%E6%BC%8F%E8%A1%A5%E7%BC%BA-2-%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90st/</guid><description>核心结论 细节 SUID 改变进程有效用户 普通用户执行带 SUID 的二进制程序时，进程临时获得该程序属主权限，典型例子是 /usr/bin/passwd SGID 对文件和目录含义不同 用在可执行文件上</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>Linux</category><category>Linux操作系统-查漏补缺</category></item><item><title>Linux查漏补缺-1-链接</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2022-10-25-linux%E6%9F%A5%E6%BC%8F%E8%A1%A5%E7%BC%BA-1-%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5/</link><pubDate>Tue, 01 Dec 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Tue, 01 Dec 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2022-10-25-linux%E6%9F%A5%E6%BC%8F%E8%A1%A5%E7%BC%BA-1-%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5/</guid><description>核心结论 细节 目录软链接删除区分带 / 与不带 / rm &amp;lt;软链接&amp;gt;/ 触发目标目录的删除逻辑，rm &amp;lt;软链接&amp;gt; 只删除软链接文件本身 硬</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>Linux</category><category>Linux操作系统-查漏补缺</category></item><item><title>shell基础-Here Document与EOF用法</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2021-01-14-shell%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E4%B9%8Beof%E7%9A%84%E7%94%A8%E6%B3%95/</link><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 10 Aug 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2021-01-14-shell%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E4%B9%8Beof%E7%9A%84%E7%94%A8%E6%B3%95/</guid><description>核心结论 说明 EOF 不是固定关键字 它只是 here document 的结束标记，可以换成任意字符串 &amp;lt;&amp;lt;EOF 会把多行文本作为标准输入 常与 cat、ssh、mysql、tee 配合使用</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>Linux</category></item><item><title>Ubuntu常见安装软件方式(ded、appimage、snap)说明.md</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/2020-04-23-ubuntu_%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8Fdedappimagesnap%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 Nov 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Fri, 01 Nov 2019 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/2020-04-23-ubuntu_%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8Fdedappimagesnap%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E/</guid><description>重要 最重要的事: 1.安装软件 1.1 通过软件中心安装 Show Applications &amp;raquo; Search Ubuntu software center. 1.2 安装.deb文件 所有安装deb文件的方式 1.2.1 双击安装 双击.deb安装包，进入软件</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>个人工具</category></item><item><title>ubuntu系统配置+常用工具使用</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/2020-04-23-ubuntu_18.04-%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7/</link><pubDate>Tue, 01 Oct 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Tue, 01 Oct 2019 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/2020-04-23-ubuntu_18.04-%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7/</guid><description>重要 最重要的事: GoTTY&amp;ndash;将终端共享为web应用 GoTTY是一个简单的命令行工具，可以将CLI工具转换为web应用程序 使用场景</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>个人工具</category></item><item><title>ubuntu18.04初始开发环境搭建</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/2020-05-10-ubuntu18.04_%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jul 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 01 Jul 2019 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/2020-05-10-ubuntu18.04_%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/</guid><description>重要 最重要的事: 本文包括 初始包安装； 安装翻墙软件； 安装docker； 安装Goland开发环境gvm+golang-1.13； 安装前端环境np</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Docker</category><category>Go</category><category>Linux</category><category>个人工具</category></item></channel></rss>